  "description": "Harmonica in its lower register, brightness dropped, musette minimal, drive zero. CHARACTER below default (0.12 — pure low harmonica tone). SPACE high (0.75). The low C harmonica held in two hands and played with full embouchure, each note allowed to decay naturally. The Delta blues harmonica that started at night and kept going until morning.",
